  "description": "Meeting Maestro is an AI-powered meeting automation platform that generates transcripts, summaries, action items, agendas, and CRM-ready notes from your meetings. It supports Zoom, Google Meet, Teams, and uploaded recordings, with automated follow-ups and workflow integrations.",
